      "skill_active_list": {},
      "skill_passive_list": {
        "KoyDVS38VutWq0aJ": {
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Consume Air",
          "passive_description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-id=\"P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Trigger</strong></a>&nbsp;the <strong>Aero Gorger</strong> absorbs <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Air</strong></a>&nbsp;damage</p></li></ul><p>It drinks the blow down and puffs up on it, gaining <strong>1 Eaten</strong>.</p>",
          "roll": "",
          "uuid": "Actor.9yadoDh5EhIWpevl.Item.KoyDVS38VutWq0aJ"
        },
        "lmpZ4ifOcHjilCxJ": {
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Puff Up",
          "passive_description": "<p>The Gorger swells. It gains <strong>1 Eaten</strong> at the start of each of its turns, and at <strong>3 Eaten</strong> it can no longer hold itself together — it drops to 0 HP.</p>",
          "roll": "",
          "uuid": "Actor.9yadoDh5EhIWpevl.Item.lmpZ4ifOcHjilCxJ"
        },
        "qgjWRf2it0vv2bwJ": {
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Aero Explosion",
          "passive_description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-id=\"P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Trigger</strong></a>&nbsp;the <strong>Aero Gorger</strong> is reduced to 0 HP</p></li></ul><p>It goes off. Every enemy is caught in a burst of <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Air</strong></a>&nbsp;— the more it had <strong>Eaten</strong>, the worse this is, and by the third swell it is genuinely dangerous.</p>",
          "roll": "",
          "uuid": "Actor.9yadoDh5EhIWpevl.Item.qgjWRf2it0vv2bwJ"
        }
      },
