      },
      "study_text": "<p>A knot of hissing wind with something solid at the middle. Gorgers do not hunt and they do not defend themselves; they <strong>eat</strong>, and they <strong>swell</strong>, and past a certain point they stop being a monster and start being an accident. Feeding it its own element only hurries that along. Anything that will put it down quickly is worth more than anything that will put it down well.</p>",
